  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Drain and rinse the gigantes beans, and set them aside.",
    "Grill the onion and garlic until slightly charred, about 5 minutes per side.",
    "Add the grape tomatoes to the grill and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until they start to release their juices.",
    "Transfer the onion, garlic, and tomatoes to a large bowl.",
    "Add the gigantes beans, kalamata olives, feta cheese, parsley, lemon juice, and lemon zest to the bowl, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10-15 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Serve the plaki warm, with grilled rye bread on the side, if desired.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Leftovers can be stored in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
  ],
